        "link": "https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260520-bolivia-s-capital-under-siege-as-protests-and-blockades-deepen-crisis",
        "orario": "17:09",
        "timestamp": 1779289780,
        "contenuto_esteso": "Bolivia’s President Rodrigo Paz faces a deepening crisis as widespread protests and blockades leave the political capital under siege less than six months after he took office. Two weeks of road closures — spearheaded by the Bolivian Workers’ Central, COB, peasant unions and miners — have emptied markets in La Paz and depleted vital hospital oxygen reserves."
